Use case: stylized-concept, production PIXEL GAME SPRITE ATLAS. Attached image is a STYLE REFERENCE only for a Contra-like first jungle level. Create EXACTLY 12 separate isolated game asset sprites in a rigid evenly spaced 4 COLUMNS by 3 ROWS contact sheet on a genuinely TRANSPARENT background. Landscape image 1536x1024, each cell384x341, no grid lines, no labels, no numbers, no lettering anywhere. Every asset entirely within its own cell, centered, with at least 24 pixels empty margin from cell boundary; never overlap or cross cells. Style: beautifully crafted hard-edged low-res 8-bit/16-bit pixel art with chunky discrete pixel clusters and strict palette like the reference, NO antialias, NO gradients, NO soft shadow, NO photorealistic rendering. Cell positions exact:
Row1 Col1: square seamless rusty orange-brown jagged ROCK WALL TEXTURE TILE, dense small faceted angular rocks with near-black crevices, fully opaque square texture without grass, repeatable;
Row1 Col2: wide horizontal bright lime-green MOSS AND GRASS LEDGE CAP, FLAT walkable upper edge with lower dangling moss and tiny dark roots, isolated thin strip, no brown wall;
Row1 Col3: one side-view gray-blue industrial METAL BRIDGE SEGMENT, flat deck, small square railing slots above, triangular crossed under-deck braces, no supports below, tileable left-right;
Row1 Col4: a tall tropical PALM TREE with emerald pixel fronds, orange-brown trunk and ferns at base, transparent between fronds;
Row2 Col1: an imposing tall slim GRAY-BLUE MECHANICAL FORTRESS, side-view right edge wall facing left, full building with layered metal armor, stepped roof, two gun ports on its left edge one above the other, a large orange-red glowing diamond core set into the lower central wall, no plants or ground, same fortress as reference;
Row2 Col2: side-view gray-blue FLOOR TURRET facing left, round segmented armor around a dark gun barrel with red target sensor, squat rectangular base;
Row2 Col3: one side-view gray industrial WEAPON CRATE, square box, orange glowing tiny center, bolted metal frame;
Row2 Col4: one orange-red WINGED POWER-UP CAPSULE: round center with BLACK EMPTY center, symmetrical white-orange pixel wings left and right, no letter;
Row3 Col1: one side-view military olive MOTORCYCLE facing right, two black wheels, no rider, pixel exhaust and metal frame;
Row3 Col2: one side-view olive green MINI HELICOPTER facing right, angular gray cockpit, top rotor and landing skids, no pilot, fully contained;
Row3 Col3: one large round orange-yellow-white PIXEL EXPLOSION sprite, jagged star silhouette, chunky flame lobes, transparent outside;
Row3 Col4: one billowing segmented dark gray PIXEL SMOKE puff sprite, opaque gray color clusters with a stepped outer silhouette, transparent outside.
All assets rendered from the side for a 2D side-scrolling shooter. Cohesive scale-independent pixel craft, not a scene, no baked ground under any sprite except the fully rectangular rock texture tile. Use all 12 cells exactly in this row-major order. Transparent background, no checkerboard pattern painted into image.

Use case: stylized-concept. Production 2D shooter CHARACTER ANIMATION SPRITE SHEET, matching the attached first-level design. The attached picture is STYLE REFERENCE ONLY. Make EXACTLY 24 isolated pixel sprites in a STRICT REGULAR GRID of 8 COLUMNS by 3 ROWS, landscape1536x1024. Each cell192x341, every sprite centered in its cell and fully contained with at least 18px empty margin. Transparent background (real alpha), no solid backdrop, no checkerboard, no colored glow, no soft shadows, no grid lines, no labels, no text. All humanoids face RIGHT, side view. Consistent head/body size and anatomy within a row, crisp chunky 8-bit/16-bit pixel craft, visible squared pixel clusters, black outlines and 3-4 shades per material, like the original Contra NES commandos from the reference. Athletic bare-armed muscular torsos, compact black-gray assault rifles. Sprites should read at only 28-32 logical pixels high; no tiny painterly details, no antialiasing, no modern 3D, no chibi heads.
ROW1: SAME RED COMMANDO in all eight cells: bare muscular peach torso with tiny black tactical harness, red headband, RED pants, black boots, dark brown short hair.
ROW2: SAME BLUE COMMANDO in all eight cells: bare muscular peach torso with tiny black tactical harness, blue headband, BLUE pants, black boots, dark brown short hair.
